  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d23097a2c4a85d066c6a083",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注其压倒性的力量吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ee6cf6c31688cf707fecd4d27310b0343d2eb6c5d5c29d9d1d54c834452cde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc59bd4185338f72b46c320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注其压倒性的根性吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df748fea3fa42f61ccef820ffae2f22af5a1a863eaa7605609770208d7a91db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a37210b3aaf3263cd510c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注其压倒性的智力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6cc85f38daac8eb631cb03fa4541419bfc41a2919c83cc7118e414f9618378",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "11207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ca38233516e0d5b192300b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要关注本次状况良好的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3f1bc675404f2bf1bb1766bbb192fe4cd76ae7abab52f16756cd5ec9fc59cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7fdb5cff0131ca8c27bfd66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得2胜，战绩优异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "883225ef2797beabc9a0948ad89c48000661d863c2be81ff706267aa9433ff45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea93efff3dca3f1808a19113",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成功以拿下胜利而扬名，是必须关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5deef7f29a0cddd6f3dde2869035b018f56bb05538642df269aaf303cc725b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41673889fab8a07c99bc7978",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总胜率<total_win_percent>%，是备受期待的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0696be8a31d7eb8a8ffc10277e15c6bd9ad4c73b316e2dafd93424790a84b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb432f67c16bdc2e1c4942c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "经历过无数激战，实力坚强的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36558ee00de20d389d73baabacba5bf46f64af5ea14e4414e518518e32b00b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d941b6717858dab4e44dde7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为40%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06a6905295ea06cad9605f2a30d545f0738cff0f33dc2ec654a840a0aa20087",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fac0f7a77347fb707fcf54d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beda041d80e8df4f73bcacaba420066a331ec471e7012c9ad3c0840e7b2d8de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264f8c2d0b71a763f1ca1997",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望发挥本领，掌握胜利……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cc2c9ee1a48ea5be80c8e74af3d708e0963abacdfef6562bac9b52963b48d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31056a99e37a148130aad067",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在预赛确实拿下胜利的实力，足以和决赛的对手抗衡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "104dc06e8c5512696feb5ced5bcbac6030f0cd62473a954ce1cfdd330aa79e76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8470746f9f9f233f9e9a31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今在这次大赛的活跃表现只能用十分出色来形容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc4f9e14826e71352845b502e2d28657298fc3cd6c38033dccaa72305148961",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d625ac5c6147257047fd60e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能将粉丝的声援化作力量，彻底发挥与生俱来的爆发力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "245ae2a388355170d8053183b18e3ed6cf8d5ac9da08f1364945104874f46bbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78403bb5d4f3a313092a33cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先要拿下1胜！在这场竞赛倾尽全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca18d8b6269c7e930331181df4f33ed1b12e931d4926204f1d515b641d3427f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "1202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80fc8627170453d3dd92972e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "划下完美的句号吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1e0eec27cf72e40556bee2832618c7f7e6884ee31d0a88a9225f703fb7a78a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:460326285b4e07afa521585f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拿下第1名吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1af81aab7fa88bb731e2da4c954dfcd2040960816090511908781b554b9fb25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064d0a793beed73bd073ff48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在就前往顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a4ed1815688084ee0a36f22a5dc7e24dbeebc758705c2e8a440eec1c020388",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "120202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d655381dada022a18927fc83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也毫无疑问会是强力候补之一吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048472094b3db4e7045c4925808803d7b1fc5e40a4f99ebc85a01f21f119346f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6270c4401f29f90ac1ffc913",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能充分发挥坚强实力的强大赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8baee69255fc17c72b95eec02fc1de129c8be166f7f67d8fda1be4e42b10c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a546c890ddc019261fb2f91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "连面对强敌也能确实取胜的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20305ad7e5e8f301e4adc3dd3c08cf2d0bf7df90f9abbf55f6768a5364419fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ceb665120d38d3a1840e42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够响应众多粉丝的期待吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "726a1735ba2e9e9b18869b3ad978ea5932369d3650a6762d24e44ff061ad826b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9766e6bd6fb4c800649b27cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝向战况绝对会非常火热的竞赛，前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535179d05bf1befe000c4251179870eccf827d17ae49796101af88fb793a5d6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f404738393955c204a363643",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这场竞赛中也是必须关注的1人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd79331b38ac2866c69cfbddff444f601c7bede1cfa49ef0de31c7d7c6acfad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "12202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd7588ccf6e6fedd8f4958d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得3胜，战绩亮眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89fb695d7a033d269ececd3ccac8eae790a77f91e9c803072d3bec820ee5713",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ea3b576a4edf6c08f6eca2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前的胜率为<total_win_percent>%的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed2a6dd94232ef2d05211d08cb25f7e09d42e2dc6242a35305279098400537c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febb1921a79c19c428103527",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超受期待的赛马娘，目前为止的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04996aacd9c0b334b227f9edfd5ac1be95116b1f78378a3e6b84b174dacd9ed9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c309ebea9bcb15585603b937",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在预赛获得<total_win>胜的惊人赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc60000f72ec80121503e15deeb2ed8736696b4363653aaef391c638852c9478",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3832f9abc22cbed4faaabb9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为60%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "524e890f34346576068fa19c92c4a2b741ddc6fb4616e2c419dcc197938b0479",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc529609b73793a770f4d80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前在这次大赛的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3037b413958e4383940a47dc79ae2987be41b5087f30fcde2c82acef2ee2bcc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb956bf23defaf1ad3062390",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去5战中获得3胜，完全是强势股。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e222a5c0bc9bf57512ff68b5b1009770ab97ab7963ba7f56859b563cc127b152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d02d31fba1432c89582bd154",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以压倒性实力为傲，支持度与实力都急速攀升的强势股。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b5681ec2ad4cd16d55a1d54c8087f945892c1b04e795af758bbb2fd8a4ba02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e78a75b8a404b1060d31bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "压倒性的表现，和在关键时刻那无以伦比的决胜实力实在无人能比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f25dccdc6c042088a9f42cdd8a3997cb09f7b8425130623987a8bc9c98c790a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90c6955cd7dc74b600236a45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "带着符合这个盛大舞台的成绩、实力以及幸运来到了这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2e2c21a890ff64f17f0b5ee4da9d72e6b2d85677b007c11fbd864a4f1c7612",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95822a16ba7d169eded70981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛也用令人兴奋不已的比赛迷倒众人吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1420ed198839846d17c9c7bf271da443635ae606a529590f42500884cf6db6fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30837e60a8c9913e650d9519",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拚上全力，迈向优胜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f859887bc8428902f8a6b83d47cc3c0dbf400476b8ca1f3ed02473bbc1b12147",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:233e76c87b0fc0af28bab1d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次大赛王者的位子，绝对不会让给任何人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c76f8c14fe5c031bf621d2e91094029e7ce1274c571549dc67d6f642e79ba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "130202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72b69ecec353fcc30759ed6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毫无疑问是状态绝佳的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6609038a9cc0ffd819056c81228b14cc9a8a4bd426511f22d555dd150541e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d643f799275b6f18c08b7886",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以势如破竹的气势拿下胜利，是该关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc5756a0dbb29e7217ade90fac85483bb130963fd20a03090ef16f3dd64fa6dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c0f16347c075882298c016",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝绝对会想关注，目前状态绝佳的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a7ab092e63e62baaae254bf62ca15eae783a7699f528dd94bd940d4523aa02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3087020f4a40681b9b76ed96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尤其是出色的速度，拥有其他人难以望其项背的潜能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c6ade3d270eebce13784bb517dae29d16d19bbd627b719cfef76799f36a84bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999f06fb266f4528cff443de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尤其是出色的耐力，拥有其他人难以望其项背的潜能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20fba5713a578a192dd45a73d9678e9d808e451619ac674fe2eeb087f7200bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141c8aa18d851adcb338cb7b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尤其是出色的力量，拥有其他人难以望其项背的潜能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5942ca062ba82e79b5cccdf11b631daa08bb3cb559f134a8321f1a16209ae8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d812819386c8af54429125b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尤其是出色的根性，拥有其他人难以望其项背的潜能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69390c24ea7552fd28ac618c8b10a1df63ebf02d0b18a614a031e96775447ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932e46a43a35db8b7c3d829c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尤其是出色的智力，拥有其他人难以望其项背的潜能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ad7e9ae1463bf5a64eb5749ef21870fe82382a9c7a22e6229d2ea147b6587f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e152837b61121f8dbf139517",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次竞赛也最被看好吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "108541d6445991e0ba85c9e5fd48c1568ff53ba39b82510720fd1f8aa42d7f66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ed39b3668da73f89c48ae0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好，这次会让人见识到怎么样的表现呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25a734449a75ecfc8aa601dacdd1da8b3603dda6d9a09ddb995c57eaec459f5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "13201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c86356c63cd1d1a8493136",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次也是令人目不转睛的一战！",
