        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d821edca7394a857ceafd169",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为「最强赛马娘」的会是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "120451aedbe89f63a3bd1780baa3591903fee909c89bc57eff444d46b8b631a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67b681b86b2bbc6b6cf54f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为惊人的80%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d8da7bf63ff0abe46ed3e46d9aa44b02198dcdb438bd60fc94b5b21c23b67f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a9601f3a64e978d38682024",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>的胜率为<total_win_percent>%。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beda041d80e8df4f73bcacaba420066a331ec471e7012c9ad3c0840e7b2d8de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "14002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:902d3c0231338b277527c525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是无论何时都会让人想声援她的赛马娘。也是值得寄托梦想的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d50c1dc78e5bb5594ba978e6bfcda39e57de91637047361cd0f9a77765de5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "140100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5cdbcbb6ca9b82a4496f73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是无论何时都会让人想声援她的赛马娘。也是值得寄托梦想的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d50c1dc78e5bb5594ba978e6bfcda39e57de91637047361cd0f9a77765de5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
